  "job_B19.5_20251003_114444": {
    "chunk_text": "nihta naman w\u00e6ron Urbanus, Prilidanus, Epolanus. JA24A11 \u00d0is w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e cl\u00e6ne biscop, ond his cl\u00e6nnes swi\u00f0e m\u00e6re w\u00e6s. JA25A1 On \u00f0one fif ond twentig\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Paules gehwerfnes to Criste. JA25A2 Se w\u00e6s \u00e6r nemned Sauwlus ond he w\u00e6s Cristenra manna ehtere \u00e6r ond cwellere. JA25A4 Ond \u00f0a f\u00e6ringa on midne d\u00e6g com leoht ofer hine of heofonum, ond stefn clypade \u00feus JA25A7 Ic eom Ihesus, \u00f0\u00e6t is h\u00e6lend, \u00feone \u00feu ehtest. JA25A8 Ond \u00fea \u00e6fter \u00f0issum he onfeng fullwihte, ond his nama w\u00e6s Paulus geciged, ond he w\u00e6s FE28A1 Sanctus Iohannes hine \u00fe\u00e6m men on niht ond hine het gewitan mid \u00fey heafde on Fenice \u00fe\u00e6re FE28A3 Swa \u00fe\u00e6t Iohannes heafod ferde. FE28A4 Hwilum hit h\u00e6fdon geleaffulle men, hwilum swi\u00f0e ungeleaffulle, ond \u00e6ghw\u00e6r hit scan mid FE28A7 \u00d0onne se solmona\u00f0 bi\u00f0 geendod, \u00feonne bi\u00f0 seo niht feowertyne tida lang, ond se d\u00e6g tyn MA00A1 On \u00f0\u00e6m \u00feriddan mon\u00f0e on geare bi\u00f0 an ond \u00ferittig daga, ond se mon\u00f0 is nemned on l\u00e6den MA02A1 On \u00feone \u00e6fteran d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes geleornes sancte Ceaddan. MA02A2 Ond \u00fe\u00e6s wundor ond lif Beda se leornere wrat on Angelcynnes boc",
